KianCode's src/tools/workspace-patch.ts is a modified derivative. The original
Rust update-hunk parser and matching behavior were translated to TypeScript,
limited to one existing file per call, bounded by input and target size, and
combined with required SHA-256 conflict checks, unique-match rejection,
workspace path enforcement, atomic replacement, and restore checkpoints.

